screen.GI_CONFIG=Global Illumination Config
option.GI=Global Illumination
option.GI.comment=Traces sky light and bounced light through the voxel volume. Needs Voxel Volume Size 256 or lower.
option.WORLD_SPACE_REFLECTIONS=World-Space Reflections
option.WORLD_SPACE_REFLECTIONS.comment=Water, glass and puddle reflections that the screen-space trace misses are traced through the GI voxels. Needs Global Illumination.
option.GI_STRENGTH=Bounce Strength
option.GI_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of light bounced off lit surfaces.
option.GI_COLOR=Colour Bleed
option.GI_COLOR.comment=How strongly bounced light tints the ambient colour. Brightness stays the same. 1.0 is physically based.
option.GI_MULTI_BOUNCE=Multi Bounce
option.GI_MULTI_BOUNCE.comment=How much light keeps bouncing after the first bounce. 0.00 is a single bounce.
option.GI_SKY_SHADOW=Sky Shadow
option.GI_SKY_SHADOW.comment=How much traced sky occlusion replaces the old ambient light. Lower values keep interiors brighter.
option.GI_SCREEN_TRACE=Screen Space Tracing
option.GI_SCREEN_TRACE.comment=Rays test the screen for about one block before the voxel trace. Adds contact shadows, lets entities block and bounce light, and shades terrain beyond the voxel volume.

screen.GI_QUALITY_CONFIG=GI Quality Config
option.GI_RESOLUTION=Trace Resolution
option.GI_RESOLUTION.comment=Resolution the rays are traced at. §c[-]§r Full traces four times as many pixels as Half.
value.GI_RESOLUTION.1=Full
value.GI_RESOLUTION.2=Half
value.GI_RESOLUTION.4=Quarter
option.GI_RAY_STEPS=Ray Length
option.GI_RAY_STEPS.comment=Most voxel steps a ray may take. A ray that runs out counts as reaching the sky. §c[-]§r Higher values decrease performance.
option.GI_ACCUMULATION=Accumulation Time
option.GI_ACCUMULATION.comment=Seconds of history blended into the result. Higher is smoother but reacts slower to changes.
option.GI_FILTER=Denoise Strength
option.GI_FILTER.comment=Strength of the blur applied to the traced result. 0.00 turns it off.
option.GI_LEAF_PASS=Leaf Translucency
option.GI_LEAF_PASS.comment=Share of rays that pass through leaves. 0.00 makes leaves solid for GI.
